  "summary": "You can measure the melting temperature, melting enthalpy, and crystallization behavior of your PCL using the TA Instruments DSC250 (EQ18). To understand how the material flows around its melting point during extrusion, you can additionally run temperature-dependent rheology on the Discovery HR20 rheometer equipped with an Environmental Test Chamber (EQ21)."
}

