      "instrument_id": "EQ03",
      "role": "supplementary",
      "technique": "Masked Stereolithography (MSLA) 3D printing",
      "why": "It provides an alternative resin 3D printing platform with high screen resolution for fabricating detailed porous scaffolds.",
