  "clarifying_question": null,
  "summary": "You can fabricate your resin scaffold using the Envision One DLP printer (EQ02) or the Elegoo Saturn 4 Ultra MSLA printer (EQ03), both serving as supplementary preparation instruments. For characterizing surface pore morphology at high magnification, the Philips XL30 environmental SEM (EQ10) is the primary instrument. Note that if you need to analyze internal 3D pore interconnectivity rather than just the surface, micro-CT would be required but is not listed in the available equipment."
}

