      "technique": "Environmental scanning electron microscopy (ESEM)",
      "why": "It provides high-resolution 2D visualization of nanoscale surface morphology and texture across your polymer samples, though it cannot directly quantify 3D height profiles or RMS roughness without specialized stereo-reconstruction tools.",
